
## 1.0.36

### Live TV Spotlight + Recommended For You (Home Frontend)
- NEW: Live TV Spotlight widget on the Home feed — surfaces your imported IPTV channels (live-pill hero + quick-jump channel chips) right from Discover, powered by the existing IPTV source backend.
- NEW: Home "Recommended For You" shelf driven by the media-weights engine (genre-tag scoped) — playback now feeds media weights (db:addMediaWeight) so the shelf gets live signal.
- NEW: Home "Live TV" + "Recommended" heroes/shelves with i18n in all 10 locales.
- IMPROVED: xHamster/XVideos/XNXX title scrapers hardened (anchor title/text fallbacks, duration-only/untitled rejection), Hentaimama settle/retry, Hanime genre weights.

## 1.0.35

### Recommendations Engine (Because You Watched)
- NEW: Backend media-weights recommendation engine (db / media_weights table) with genre-tag scoped weights.
- NEW: db:addMediaWeight and db:getTopMediaWeights database + IPC + preload wiring.
- NEW: Home page shelves retitled (Free Movies shelf + Live Channels header).
- IMPROVED: Deduplicated recommendation IPC handlers.
